{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01VDGBaPYdzKx1mYDySJpSLJ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01U3iuVf9FEpcyw3o4Bad59z","name":"mcp__agent-ml-research__read_project_file","input":{"project":"xling_calib_direction","file":"memory.md","max_chars":0},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3551,"cache_read_input_tokens":18623,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":3551,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":65,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_015qKBjEHGZRu2Z1UFTanr2V","session_id":"d09a0a85-eeda-4d6e-b19c-3b10fe8c8caf","uuid":"ed6683e9-c518-4216-9315-c0ada76c0902"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01U3iuVf9FEpcyw3o4Bad59z","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0519_2/projects/xling_calib_direction/memory.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# Memory — xling_calib_direction\\\\n\\\\n## 环境配置\\\\n- **服务器**: westd-13176, 4× RTX 6000 PRO 96GB\\\\n- **环境**: conda base (`source /root/miniconda3/etc/profile.d/conda.sh && conda activate base`)\\\\n- **模型路径**: `/root/autodl-tmp/models/Qwen/Qwen2___5-7B-Instruct`（symlink `/root/autodl-tmp/models/Qwen/Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct`）\\\\n- **代码路径**: `/root/xling_calib_direction/`\\\\n- **Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct**: 28 layers (index 0-27), hidden_dim=3584\\\\n- **网络**: 不要用 `source /etc/network_turbo`（会破坏 HF SSL），用 `HF_ENDPOINT=https://hf-mirror.com`\\\\n- **模型下载**: 用 ModelScope（AutoDL 上 HF 代理太慢）\\\\n\\\\n## 数据集字段差异\\\\n- cais/mmlu: `choices` (list), `answer` (int 0-3)\\\\n- CohereForAI/Global-MMLU: `option_a/b/c/d` (str), `answer` (letter \\\\\\\"A\\\\\\\"-\\\\\\\"D\\\\\\\")\\\\n- `normalize_row()` 已处理两种格式\\\\n\\\\n## 激活提取速度\\\\n- Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct, BF16, RTX 6000 PRO 96GB: ~1 sample/s (MMLU 5-shot)\\\\n- 14K samples × 7 layers × 6 语言 ≈ 2h per GPU\\\\n\\\\n## MVP 实验关键发现 (2026-05-20)\\\\n\\\\n### Mean-shift alignment 完全无效（方法论发现）\\\\nMean-shift 对所有样本加同一常数向量 `(mean_en - mean_tgt)`。\\\\n- **不能改变 AUROC**: 经线性 probe 后等价于 logit 加常数，AUROC（rank-based）不变。\\\\n- **不能改善 calibration**: ΔECE 测试结果 0/5 语言达标。zh/ar 仅 marginal（<0.4pp），hi/sw 反而大幅恶化（+2.2pp/+6.4pp）。\\\\n- **结论**: 简单常数平移不足以 align 跨语言 representation。需要非常数方法（CDA/CORAL/Procrustes）。这是论文贡献空间。\\\\n\\\\n### Temperature scaling 有效修复 ECE\\\\n- Layer 24: T=5.36, ECE 0.1982→0.0888\\\\n- Layer 27: T=6.21, ECE 0.1951→0.0744\\\\n- T>1 说明 LogisticRegression 过于自信（overconfident），需要 softening\\\\n\\\\n### Layer 27 vs Layer 24: 最后一层更 language-specific\\\\n- EN AUROC: L27=0.7541 > L24=0.7486（最后一层英语 probe 最强）\\\\n- 但跨语言迁移: L24 全面优于 L27（zh 0.686 vs 0.661, ar 0.651 vs 0.635, hi 0.652 vs 0.626, ko 0.648 vs 0.607）\\\\n- **解读**: 最后一层 representation 更 language-specific，对 zero-shot transfer 不利。Optimal transfer layer ≠ optimal source-language layer。这是论文可讨论的有趣发现。\\\\n\\\\n### Swahili 始终最差\\\\n- Best zero-shot AUROC: sw=0.560 (L27) / 0.544 (L20)，均 < 0.58 阈值\\\\n- 与 low-resource 假设一致，论文中作为 expected limitation\\\\n\\\\n### 最终 Gate Check (2026-05-20)\\\\n- P1 ✅ PASS (AUROC=0.7541, ECE=0.0744 with temp scaling)\\\\n- P2 ✅ PASS (4/5 langs)\\\\n- P3 ✅ PASS (14.28pp)\\\\n- P4 ❌ FAIL (mean-shift 无效，0/5)\\\\n- 无 hard fail\\\\n- Overall: PARTIAL 3/4, 核心假设获强支持\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 2071, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_015qKBjEHGZRu2Z1UFTanr2V","session_id":"d09a0a85-eeda-4d6e-b19c-3b10fe8c8caf","uuid":"ebc38fd5-6bec-4d26-b668-66d48381b361","timestamp":"2026-05-20T19:38:40.228Z"}
